%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b306270d40927474785298f4cfb42e0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: signastro_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  signastro:
  - astro_sign: 0
    sign: Aries
    date: "21 mars \u2013 19 avril"
    element: Feu
    planet: Mars
    description: "<b>Under the impulse of Mars, in the 14th century, when astrology
      was part of the sciences of the world,</b> Aries bursts forth like a spark
      in the night.\L Its strength is that of beginnings, raw and sacred.\L It acts
      before it doubts, guided by the pure instinct of fire.\L In its wake, everything
      awakens, everything ignites."
  - astro_sign: 1
    sign: Taurus
    date: "20 avril \u2013 20 mai"
    element: Terre
    planet: "V\xE9nus"
    description: "<b>Guided by Venus, at a time when astrology was part of the sciences
      of the world,</b> Taurus seeks stability, beauty, and harmony.\L It builds
      with constancy and is attached to simple pleasures and the concrete world,
      reflecting the gentleness attributed to its ruling planet."
  - astro_sign: 2
    sign: Gemini
    date: "21 mai \u2013 20 juin"
    element: Air
    planet: Mercure
    description: "<b>Under the guidance of Mercury, in ancient times when the sky
      was read as a language,</b> Gemini stands out for its liveliness and curiosity.\L
      It observes, learns, and constantly transmits, carried by movement.\L Mercury,
      messenger of the gods, grants it a lively voice and an agile mind."
  - astro_sign: 3
    sign: Cancer
    date: "21 juin \u2013 22 juillet"
    element: Terre
    planet: "V\xE9nus"
    description: "<b>Guided by Venus, in the ancient order of the medieval world,</b>
      Cancer seeks stability and beauty.\L It builds slowly, with constancy, and
      is attached to simple pleasures, nature, and material security.\L Its bond
      with the concrete reflects the gentleness and sensuality of its ruling planet."
  - astro_sign: 4
    sign: Leo
    date: "23 juillet \u2013 22 ao\xFBt"
    element: Feu
    planet: Soleil
    description: "<b>Ruled by the Sun, in the time of the Middle Ages,</b> Leo naturally
      radiates.\L It creates, inspires, and guides with pride and generosity.\L Its
      star grants it warmth and authority, as well as the responsibility to shine
      without dominating."
  - astro_sign: 5
    sign: Virgo
    date: "23 ao\xFBt \u2013 22 septembre"
    element: Terre
    planet: Mercure
    description: "<b>Under the influence of Mercury, in the time of medieval knowledge,</b>
      Virgo analyzes, sorts, and acts with discernment.\L Mercury grants it precision,
      a sense of usefulness, and discernment, exercised with modesty."
  - astro_sign: 6
    sign: Libra
    date: "23 septembre \u2013 22 octobre"
    element: Air
    planet: "V\xE9nus"
    description: "<b>Under the grace of Venus, in medieval times,</b> Libra seeks
      harmony in all its relationships.\L A sign of dialogue and aesthetics, it avoids
      conflict and seeks to unite rather than divide.\L Its charm arises from its
      ability to listen and understand both sides of a situation."
  - astro_sign: 7
    sign: Scorpio
    date: "23 octobre \u2013 21 novembre"
    element: Eau
    planet: Pluton (et Mars)
    description: "<b>Under the power of Pluto \u2014 and Mars in medieval astrology
      \u2014</b> Scorpio turns toward what is hidden and unseen.\L A deep and intense
      sign, it moves through trials with passion and regenerates through transformation.\L
      Its stars grant it great inner strength and the power to be reborn after each
      passage through the shadows."
  - astro_sign: 8
    sign: Sagittarius
    date: "22 novembre \u2013 21 d\xE9cembre"
    element: Feu
    planet: Jupiter
    description: "<b>Under the benevolence of Jupiter, in medieval times,</b> Sagittarius
      moves forward carried by optimism and curiosity.\L It seeks to understand the
      world through travel, study, philosophy, or faith.\L Jupiter inspires confidence,
      a sense of justice, and a taste for intellectual and spiritual adventure."
  - astro_sign: 9
    sign: Capricorn
    date: "22 d\xE9cembre \u2013 21 janvier"
    element: Terre
    planet: Saturne
    description: "<b>Under the guardianship of Saturn, in medieval times,</b> Capricorn
      moves forward with patience and discipline.\L It progresses stone by stone,
      seeking a wisdom inscribed in time.\L Saturn teaches perseverance, responsibility,
      and self-mastery, making it a builder of lasting values."
  - astro_sign: 10
    sign: Aquarius
    date: "22 janvier - 21 f\xE9vrier"
    element: Air
    planet: Uranus
    description: "<b>Under the influence of Uranus, in medieval astrology,</b> Aquarius
      moves forward with boldness and insight.\L It turns toward new ideas and fertile
      breaks, carried by a free and visionary spirit.\L Uranus inspires invention,
      independence, and awakening, making it a bearer of avant-garde thinking and
      impulses oriented toward renewal and progress."
  - astro_sign: 11
    sign: Pisces
    date: "22 f\xE9vrier - 20 mars"
    element: Eau
    planet: Neptune
    description: "<b>Under the guidance of Neptune, in medieval astrology,</b> Pisces
      move forward guided by sensitivity and intuition.\L They evolve between the
      visible and the invisible with fluidity.\L Neptune inspires imagination, compassion,
      and mystery, making them beings oriented toward depth, dream, and understanding
      of the world."
